+ * Karun / "Modern Style" business presentation - 39 slides, 13.333 x 7.5 in.
+ *
+ * Everything is built from plain pptxgenjs calls.  Raster photos in the source
+ * deck were flat colour swatches; they are re-created here as plain coloured
+ * rectangles (see `img`).  Line-art icon glyphs become outlined placeholders
+ * (see `ic`), and the device mock-ups are drawn from native shapes (see `dev`).
+ */
